WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:17.439
okay, let's get into audience questions for
the week.

00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:18.800
Very timely one.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:25.550
Hey David, even if the Joe Biden's conspiracy
isn't literally true, as Republicans say,

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:28.189
isn't it still extraordinarily corrupt that

00:00:28.189 --> 00:00:34.510
Joe Biden's son, Hunter Biden is working for
a Ukrainian gas company and getting paid $50,000

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.510
a month?

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:40.579
So yes, I mean he, here's what you have to
distinguish and this is so, so I'm going to

00:00:40.579 --> 00:00:45.670
take the question as being a good faith question
because I do see a lot of bad faith, right

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.800
wing actors saying the real corruption is
Biden's son.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:55.760
And then I also see some good faith left way
actors saying, wait a second, I am reading

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:56.899
that it is corrupt.

00:00:56.899 --> 00:00:59.379
What was going on with Joe Biden and Hunter
Biden in Ukraine?

00:00:59.379 --> 00:01:01.210
So here's the deal.

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:11.530
We have a system that is a system built on
the status quo, revolving door, business,

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:17.280
politics, lobbying, cronyism, consultancy,
that that's the, the system that we have.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:24.790
And in this system, you have a King makers
in politics and lobbyists and elected officials

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:32.250
and campaign consultants and all of these
fo bogus consultancy positions that are made

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:36.500
available to connected people, not because
of their knowledge or skills, but because

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.979
of their connections like that exists.

00:01:38.979 --> 00:01:39.979
And that's a thing.

00:01:39.979 --> 00:01:41.940
So I'll give you an example.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:45.060
Paul Ryan, the former Republican speaker of
the house.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:49.430
As I mentioned earlier this week, is now on
the board of Fox news.

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:54.140
What does Paul Ryan really know about being
on the board of a media company?

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:57.840
It will, you can say, well, he did deal with
the FCC as a member of Congress or this or

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:58.840
that or whatever.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:03.180
The other thing, but this is just an example
of what we are talking about.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:08.040
It is the revolving door of people between
politics and industry and [inaudible], all

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.350
of that sort of stuff.

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:13.910
So when you see Joe Biden, uh, having a son,
Hunter Biden who's getting paid reportedly

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.940
50 grand a month to be an advisor or whatever
to this, uh, Ukrainian gas company, it is

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:25.510
absolutely an example of the money buys you
money and connections get you connections

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:29.370
and money status quo that we have.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.110
It is an example of that.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:39.650
It is not any particularly acute instance
of what Joe Biden is being accused of, which

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:45.250
should change the focus of the entire story
from what Donald Trump did in withholding

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:49.600
hundreds of millions of dollars in aid, in
exchange for Ukraine, agreeing to smear Joe

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:50.600
Biden.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:51.600
That should be the focus.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.830
The suppression of the whistleblowers should
be the focus.

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:56.150
So there's that angle.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:03:00.490
It's also particularly hypocritical for Trump
to be the one calling it out because Trump

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.440
is the King of these types of cronies to corrupt
instances.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:08.780
So do I have a problem with what it is that
Hunter Biden was doing?

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:09.780
Yes.

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:14.920
In the same way that hundreds and hundreds
of relatives, friends, former politicians,

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:19.860
et cetera, et cetera, are in these positions
because that's how our system is built.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:26.170
It is endemic corruption and cronyism and
it needs to be changed at the systemic level.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:31.670
But the specific conspiracy that is being
built around Joe Biden and Hunter Biden and

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:36.790
Joe Biden's saying, Oh, Hunter's in trouble
cause this company's being investigated.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:40.700
Let me get out there and start making some
threats over bank guarantees.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.170
It's not the way it went down.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:47.340
It's been widely debunked and it's just not
anything that the facts can defend.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:52.810
And that's why we need to be particularly
careful about, there's a, a, an immediate

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:59.380
Republicans don't care about this revolving
door status quo of lobbyists and politicians

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.170
and family members and all of this stuff.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.380
They love it.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.380
Okay.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:09.580
And for them to now say, Oh, the real problem
is that the son of a vice president was making

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:14.510
a bunch of money as a consultant here, and
then Joe Biden went out to save his ass.

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:19.010
They don't really care about this as an issue
and they're only using this hypocritically

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:23.139
I might add to distract from the real chaos,
the real story, which is Trump's suppression

00:04:23.139 --> 00:04:26.599
of the whistleblower and the demand that Donald
Trump on Ukraine.

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:29.979
So yeah, we'll talk about it in the sense
that we talk about the whole system as it

00:04:29.979 --> 00:04:33.449
works, but the acute story here is the one
related to Donald Trump's actions.

